      <definition>v.t. To conceal; to plant; to bury.</definition>
      <page>133</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠠᠵᠠᠷ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠪᠣᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>γazar tur --xu</transcript>
          <definition>To bury something in the ground.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠣᠳᠤ ᠪᠣᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>modu --</transcript>
          <definition>To plant a tree; to erect a post.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠺᠦᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ ᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
